00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,620
It's not just the five senses,
it's Mocchiri Date!

278
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,900
Whenever an incident happens on land,

279
00:16:16,900 --> 00:16:19,620
one pair of swim trunks solves everything.

280
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:22,520
Special detective!
Leader of the Sundagarasu!

281
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:25,260
Giant swim trunks!

282
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:33,820
Just because you're special, you don't have
to force yourself to come out, you know.

283
00:16:39,020 --> 00:16:42,760
Let this iron club make a meal of you!

284
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:47,560
Lord Ryo!

285
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,900
Lord Ryo!

286
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:52,900
Who is that woman?

287
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:00,780
Lord Ryo!

288
00:17:01,500 --> 00:17:03,200
After everything between us,

289
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:05,680
I won't forgive you for being
infatuated with another woman!

290
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,920
No, Maria, it's a misunderstanding!

291
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:11,060
Haruka-chan is the one who knows
the secret of the hidden treasure,

292
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:13,000
the daughter of the Shichifuku Shrine,

293
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:15,500
she's only helping us.

294
00:17:16,060 --> 00:17:17,120
Is that true?

295
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:19,760
It's true, it's true!

296
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:21,340
Is that so, Honda?

297
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:24,652
Whenever money's involved,

298
00:17:24,702 --> 00:17:27,020
he loses interest in everything else.

299
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:31,440
I'm sorry, Lord Ryo. I was mistaken.

300
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,860
Well, as long as you understand.

301
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:36,500
Lord Ryo is being kind!

302
00:17:37,540 --> 00:17:38,680
It's always like this.

303
00:17:38,980 --> 00:17:42,660
Anyway, thanks to Maria, we're saved.
Come on, let's go!

304
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:54,100
It's no good, it won't budge at all!

305
00:17:54,100 --> 00:17:56,160
You won't get the treasure!

306
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:00,440
How did you lot get here?

307
00:18:00,940 --> 00:18:03,900
We've taken care of all three old geezers.

308
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:05,100
N-no way.

309
00:18:05,660 --> 00:18:07,540
Come on, just do it!

310
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:08,480
Yeah!

311
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:13,080
I won't forgive anyone
who lays a hand on Ryo-sama.

312
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,800
Don't let it get cut.

313
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,800
Wow, Maria, you're amazing!

314
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:32,220
For Lord Ryo, I'd go through fire and water.

315
00:18:32,620 --> 00:18:35,740
We should've put you on
the team from the start.

316
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:36,620
Yeah, right.

317
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,100
Let's go.

318
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:41,880
Is this the entrance to the treasure room?

319
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:51,860
No good, I've pushed and pulled,
and it won't budge at all.

320
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:58,480
Isn't that it? Yes, we've made it this far.
Lord Ryo, wait a moment, this is...

321
00:18:58,480 --> 00:19:01,720
No, it's stuck fast!

322
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:06,220
Damn, they made it even more secure!

323
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:07,700
Aaaaah!

324
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:15,520
Aaaaah! Senpai, this is, this is...

325
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:21,660
No doubt about it, it's Tokugawa
Ieyasu's trillion-yen treasure!

326
00:19:22,020 --> 00:19:24,040
Thanks for all your hard work What?

327
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:25,500
Senpai!

328
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:27,700
Honda!

329
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:28,760
Honda-san!

330
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:34,740
Hey, don't move!
Move, and this guy's life is over.

331
00:19:36,220 --> 00:19:39,140
Damn it!
You bastards were still hanging around!

332
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:42,140
Honda!

333
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:52,540
W-what? You're Haruka!

334
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:56,660
That's right,
I'm the leader of the ninja clan,

335
00:19:56,710 --> 00:19:57,960
Sanada Haruka!

336
00:19:57,960 --> 00:20:01,920
Sanada? Don't tell me you're
a descendant of Sanada Yukimura?

337
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:08,820
That's right. Our Sanada clan has been searching
for Ieyasu's buried gold for generations.

338
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:12,560
Damn it, of all the busy times!

339
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:21,080
Senpai, I just remembered, there's no daughter at the Ganso Benzaiten Shrine.
It's a son.

340
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:24,860
Remembering now is too late.

341
00:20:26,180 --> 00:20:30,380
Now, if you want to save this guy's life,
hand over the treasure.

342
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:35,900
Ugh! Fine!
I'll smash this treasure to pieces!

343
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:37,080
Argh!

344
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,160
Whatever!

345
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:38,820
Where?

346
00:20:38,860 --> 00:20:41,680
Got it! We're running off with the treasure!

347
00:20:42,220 --> 00:20:42,740
Yes!

348
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:45,860
Hey! Not again!

349
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:48,800
Someone's waiting for us,
and they're asking why!

350
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,320
Argh!

351
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,905
Uh...

352
00:20:53,955 --> 00:20:57,540
Making a fool of us like that!

353
00:20:58,420 --> 00:21:00,140
Argh! Damn it!

354
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,340
Hand it over!

355
00:21:10,580 --> 00:21:13,220
It's a treasure worth a trillion yen!
Who'd hand that over!

356
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:17,380
It's just getting started!

357
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:18,620
Watch out!

358
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:30,060
We did it! First floor!
The exit's right there!

359
00:21:35,420 --> 00:21:37,920
Don't think you're getting away.

360
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:42,800
Lord Ryo

361
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:43,680
Senpai

362
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:47,240
My butt's split in two!

363
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:49,700
Was it already cracked from the start?

364
00:21:49,700 --> 00:21:51,160
I split it into three.

365
00:22:22,460 --> 00:22:24,800
These are stilts and rattle drums.

366
00:22:24,800 --> 00:22:31,000
Spinning tops and bamboo dragonflies, what is all this?
These are all children's toys!

367
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:36,680
The Toyotomi remnants, you've done well.

368
00:22:37,280 --> 00:22:44,980
I lived as a hostage in the Imagawa household when I was young,
so I hardly ever played as a child.

369
00:22:46,060 --> 00:22:48,740
Only after I grew up did I try
these games for the first time,

370
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:52,140
and I learned how fun
children's games can be.

371
00:22:52,880 --> 00:22:56,340
But if my retainers saw me like this,

372
00:22:56,340 --> 00:22:58,700
the dignity of the Justice
Great Shogun would be lost.

373
00:22:59,160 --> 00:23:02,020
So I secretly built a hidden Ura-Edo Castle

374
00:23:02,020 --> 00:23:04,260
and decided to sneak off here to play.

375
00:23:05,460 --> 00:23:07,160
What?! Hand it over!

376
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:11,100
The Toyotomi family's treasure went
toward building the secret Edo Castle

377
00:23:11,100 --> 00:23:14,780
and the massive mechanism that
makes the castle rise and sink.

378
00:23:14,980 --> 00:23:16,340
It's all been used up.

379
00:23:16,340 --> 00:23:17,980
Sorry about that.

380
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:21,140
Don't mess with us!

381
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:22,520
Ryo-san

382
00:23:22,520 --> 00:23:23,660
Senpai

383
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:27,900
All that effort for nothing, what a waste!

384
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:38,720
Oh no, the castle's collapsing!

385
00:23:39,260 --> 00:23:41,060
Was that an important pillar?

386
00:23:41,060 --> 00:23:41,680
Run!

387
00:24:04,740 --> 00:24:06,180
Too bad, Ryotsu.

388
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:09,100
What's this Tokugawa
treasure supposed to be?

389
00:24:09,700 --> 00:24:13,260
Wait, if we haul up that golden castle,

390
00:24:13,760 --> 00:24:15,360
apparently it was just gold plating.

391
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:17,180
Gulp... no way.

392
00:24:17,660 --> 00:24:20,260
And then, as usual, Fuji TV

393
00:24:20,260 --> 00:24:23,660
is demanding we pay for the damage
to their broken studio building.

394
00:24:23,660 --> 00:24:26,760
Damn it, another ending like this?

395
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:30,360
Hahaha, Senpai, you're just too funny!

396
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:32,060
Shut up!

397
00:24:45,800 --> 00:24:51,260
An afternoon after the rain,
as if someone is calling out

398
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:57,900
I walked looking back,
my hand tugged along by Gacha

399
00:24:58,780 --> 00:25:04,960
That strange feeling I had back then

400
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:10,320
So on the tiles of the arcade street

401
00:25:10,320 --> 00:25:16,120
I tried walking only on the black ones

402
00:25:18,500 --> 00:25:22,260
Everyone was a child once

403
00:25:22,260 --> 00:25:24,420
but everyone has forgotten

404
00:25:25,300 --> 00:25:28,400
the politicians with
their self-important faces

405
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:31,700
and the aunties with blue eyeshadow

406
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:34,700
Try turning the corner

407
00:25:35,300 --> 00:25:37,280
that corner

408
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:42,480
You can meet everyone, everyone

409
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:47,120
Over there, there are turtles (Kame-ari)

410
00:25:48,080 --> 00:25:50,400
Surely there are turtles (Kame-ari)

411
00:25:51,700 --> 00:25:55,580
Everyone, come to our town

412
00:25:56,500 --> 00:25:57,180
Thank you

